000746r 2               ; --- Error trampolines ------------------------------------------------------
000746r 2               ; The MSBASIC convention is "ldx #code / jmp ERROR".  Our BasError takes
000746r 2               ; the code in A, so translate.
000746r 2               BasErrorVec:
000746r 2  8A                   txa
