0010F0r 2               ;   Inline-ported from msbasic-master/{var,array,string,memory}.s and
0010F0r 2               ;   misc2.s (GivAyf/SngFlt).  All MSBASIC externals are resolved here:
0010F0r 2               ;
0010F0r 2               ;     SynErr / MemErr / IqErr / Gme / SubErr        - error trampolines
0010F0r 2               ;     ChkCom / ChkCls / ChkNum / ChkStr             - parser predicates
0010F0r 2               ;     MakInt / FrmNum / FrmEvl                      - minimal stubs (only
0010F0r 2               ;                                                     handle literal unsigned
0010F0r 2               ;                                                     decimals via Fin; full
0010F0r 2               ;                                                     evaluator wired in a
0010F0r 2               ;                                                     later phase)
0010F0r 2               ;     IsLetC                                        - ASCII letter test
0010F0r 2               ;     PtrGet / Array / GetAry                       - variable lookup
0010F0r 2               ;     StrIni / StrSpa / GetSpa / PutNew / MovStr    - string allocation
0010F0r 2               ;     Garbag (and helpers)                          - string GC
0010F0r 2               ;     Bltu / Reason                                 - block-up-move helpers
0010F0r 2               ;     AyInt / GivAyf / SngFlt                       - FP <-> 16-bit int
0010F0r 2               ;     BasCmdClr                                     - implements CLR / NEW core
0010F0r 2               ; =============================================================================
